			"Message": "style(Common): Format EffectSmol, Result, Errors, and Container modules\n\nConsolidate imports and apply consistent formatting across core async primitives and service container. Changes include:\n\n- Container.ts: Merge Async imports into single statement, format registerAll tuple type, inline single-line error throw\n- EffectSmol.ts: Condense fail helper to single expression\n- Errors.ts: Expand Tagged and makeError generic signatures across multiple lines, format StateLockPoisoned type\n- Result.ts: Inline Ok/Err/unwrap/unwrapErr arrow functions\n- EffectSmol.test.ts: Reorganize imports alphabetically by source, inline Promise.resolve argument\n\nNo behavioral changes — purely whitespace and formatting consistency across the Common crate's foundational modules.",
