			"Message": "feat(Common): Add TerminalPropertyChanged Sky event and improve transport documentation\n\nAdd a new `TerminalPropertyChanged` Sky event (`sky://terminal/property-changed`) fired when `localPty:updateProperty` modifies a terminal's title (property 2/3) or shell type (property 5). The payload `{ id, property, value }` allows the Sky Bridge to forward updates to the xterm panel so workbench tab labels and icons refresh without a full round-trip.\n\nSimultaneously clean up whitespace across IPC and Transport modules by removing extraneous blank lines after type and impl definitions in EstablishHostConnection, ProxyCallToSideCar, CircuitBreaker, Correlation, Metrics, Registry, and Retry. Update module documentation for IPC, WASM, and gRPC transports to accurately describe their implementations (Unix sockets/TCP loopback, tokio mpsc channels for Grove WASM host, and tonic HTTP/2 unary calls respectively). Reformat tsconfig.json arrays for consistency.",
			"SHA": "e296986baf14a24b3bc9983ef691d69b7f508dd2"
		}
	],
